# MVP
- We can send an invite link for the server
- User register flow
    - All users open the same invite link
    - Pick from a dropdown of preselected, unclaimed names
    - Provide their address
    - Redirected to home
- Home page
    - Your name
    - Your drawn name, tap to reveal
    - Your address, editable
    - Your wish list, editable
    - Link to chats
- Chat page
    - Every users has two chats: one with their secret santa, one with thier giftee
    - User can toggle between the two chats
- Names
    - Names will be pre-seeded into the db
    - Matches will be computed outside the app and uploaded to the db prior to any user registrations
    - Rules: don't match with the same as last year, no significant others

# Ideas for later
- Each user can say if they shipped their gift

